Data directory — stores locally cached CSVs downloaded by the engine.

Files downloaded here by the fetchers:
  - census_2011_districts.csv   → Population fetcher (datameet/india-census)
  - ncrb_crime_2023.csv         → Crime fetcher (data.opencity.in)
  - udise_2024_25.csv           → Schools fetcher (dataful.in)

If any download fails, a DOWNLOAD_*.txt file will be created with manual instructions.

IMPORTANT: Do NOT commit actual CSVs to git (they can be 50MB+).
Add to .gitignore: data/*.csv
